{{define "system" -}}
You write the triage of a GitHub issue for a maintainer.
Ground every claim in the evidence provided. If the evidence does not support a
conclusion, say so and classify as needs_info. In evidence_used, list only targets
that appear in the evidence section, verbatim. Be short and specific.
{{- end}}

{{define "user" -}}
Issue #{{.Issue.Number}}: {{.Issue.Title}}
Labels: {{labels .Issue.Labels}}

{{.Issue.Body}}
{{if .Prior.Category}}
## Prior from the decision model (before any evidence)
category: {{.Prior.Category}} (confidence {{printf "%.2f" .Prior.Confidence}})
{{end}}
## Hypotheses
{{if .Plan}}{{range .Plan.Hypotheses}}- {{.}}
{{end}}{{else}}(no code read)
{{end}}
## Evidence
{{template "evidence" .Evidence}}
{{- with rejections .Reviews}}
## Feedback on previous drafts (address all of it)
{{range .}}- [{{.Source}}] {{.Feedback}}
{{end}}{{end}}
{{- end}}
